{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30357","headline":"送令狐郎中赴郢州 · 赵嘏","name":"送令狐郎中赴郢州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐幕才多始拜侯，一门清贵动神州。\n霜蹄晓驻秦云断，野斾晴翻郢树秋。\n几处尘生随候骑，半江帆尽见分流。\n大冯罢相吟诗地，莫惜频登白雪楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}